  "purpose": "The ORFs actually expressed in SRP342112, taken from the deposited cassette MZ541859.1 (pGLBRCY-HO-mIBAIlv5-KanMX-HO, Gambacorta et al. 2022). Every ORF in it is codon-optimized, so the wild-type CDS used in the first pass are the wrong reference for everything except ilvC, which the plasmid does not contain.",
